===Etymology===
Via {{etyl|fr|en}} {{m|fr|pastiche}}, from {{etyl|it|en}} {{m|it|pasticcio||pie, something blended}}, from {{etyl|VL.|en}} {{m|la|*pasticium}}, from {{etyl|la|en}} {{m|la|pasta||dough, pastry cake, paste}}, from {{etyl|grc|en}} {{m|grc|παστά||barley porridge}}, from {{m|grc|παστός||sprinkled with salt}}.

